&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;A data-informed approach that turns funnel insights into practical actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Strong organization across multiple requisitions and clear written and verbal communication across time zones, with attention to detail and candidate care.&lt;/li&gt;
